# Contexto = raíz del monorepo (docker build -f apps/web/Dockerfile .)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
*.AppImage
*.flatpakrepo
apps/web/playwright-report
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/playwright
# De api y mobile solo se necesita el package.json (el lockfile los incluye)
apps/api/*
!apps/api/package.json
apps/mobile/*
!apps/mobile/package.json
